# Cut, on the row of trees outside Eterna City's Pokemon Center.
#
# The tree's coordinates are its object event's own, out of
# res/field/events/events_eterna_city.json; the player stands on the tile south
# of it, so the shared north-walking script faces it, cuts it and walks through
# where it was.

name CUTTER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 30001
money 3000
badge BADGE_ID_FOREST
party SPECIES_BIBAREL 30 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_CUT
map MAP_HEADER_ETERNA_CITY 304 522 FACE_UP
